invariant: INV-64
file: srv_cookie.c
catches: cnsa2_server_test
reason: the profile's server keys its HelloRetryRequest cookie with
  HMAC-SHA-256 and leaves the last 16 bytes of the 48-byte MAC as the
  frame held them. test_cookie computes HMAC-SHA-384 over the body itself
  and requires the cookie's last 48 bytes to be that MAC.

--- old
    hmac_sha384(key, CH_SRV_COOKIE_KEY_LEN, msg, n, mac);
--- new
    hmac_sha256(key, CH_SRV_COOKIE_KEY_LEN, msg, n, mac);
